{"id":"vod_md_6260","vodId":"6260","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"转生王女与天才千金的魔法革命","name_cn":"转生王女与天才千金的魔法革命","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231024-1/16706ea292f221c4f76eb663015089e2.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个几乎人人都会使用魔法的世界之中，艾妮丝菲亚（千本木彩花 配音）是帕雷提亚王国的公主，在童年时代，她意外的重获了前世的记忆。但因为无法使用魔法，艾妮丝菲亚在贵族之中饱受轻视。但对于乐观积极的艾妮丝菲亚来说，这并不会使她感到苦恼，她建立了独特的魔法理论，专注于研究通过科学的手段达成魔法效果的方法。一次偶然中，艾妮丝菲亚邂逅了名叫尤菲莉亚（石见舞菜香 配音）的公爵千金，她被剥夺了王妃候补地位，正处于迷惘之中。就这样，艾妮丝菲亚接纳了尤菲莉亚，两人共同开始了对于魔法理论的研究。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-24 08:19:26","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/zbxfbYNW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/IVoBRSme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/TLSXpQ1P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/Qvk1GEFt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/SWpf6SDY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/ZqaujvHb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/LFicAs6g/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/nT4UySL8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/GCO5zUYU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/X2TxeNs3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/Z3dMP6zv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/NIpEIQYv/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:42.425Z"}